==Finnish==

===Pronunciation===
*{{IPA|lang=fi|/ˈmehilæinen/}}

===Etymology===
From earlier *''meši'', from {{proto|Finno-Ugric|mekse|lang=fi}}.  Cognates include Estonian {{term|mesilane|lang=et}} and Hungarian {{term|méh|lang=hu}}.

